      "updated": 1787677643290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instituions\n\n-> Management of current students and alumini's\n-> Monitor Students skill\n-> Monitor Industry Demand\n-> Monitor Internships & Placement\n-> Overall Dashboard & Analytics\n\n* Institutions will work overall for students/alumini's",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instituions\n\n-> Management of current students and alumini's\n-> Monitor Students skill\n-> Monitor Industry Demand\n-> Monitor Internships & Placement\n-> Overall Dashboard & Analytics\n\n* Institutions will work overall for students/alumini's",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
