    {
      "id": "eV79KcyhLHvOfhetjcSTO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4737.723539949024,
      "y": -4994.790136970878,
      "width": 1414.09912109375,
      "height": 2275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 614597290,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 1214318372,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788714544510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for the futer \nHere is the structured breakdown of your Excalidraw whiteboard data, organized by user persona, functional modules, and technical architecture.\n\n---\n\n### Core Stakeholders & Pain Points\n\n| Persona | Core Pain Points & Needs | Key Deliverables / Features |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Students** | • Lack of clarity on industry standards & trends<br>\n\n<br>• Need objective skill measurement<br>\n\n<br>• Skill gaps without targeted learning paths<br>\n\n<br>• Irrelevant internship applications | • Dynamic Skill Assessment & gap visualization<br>\n\n<br>• Personalized career roadmap & training resources<br>\n\n<br>• Verified Digital Portfolio (skills, projects, certifications)<br>\n\n<br>• Automated resume builder tuned to specific job descriptions<br>\n\n<br>• Application tracking & AI HelpBot |\n| **Faculty** | • Low visibility into domain-specific industry exposure<br>\n\n<br>• Inability to align syllabus with live tech trends | • Self-service discovery for industrial training<br>\n\n<br>• Faculty Development Programs (FDPs)<br>\n\n<br>• Industry sabbaticals & consultancy matchmaking |\n| **Institutions** | • Disconnected student & alumni records<br>\n\n<br>• Blindness to real-time market skill demands | • Cohort-level skill & placement readiness dashboards<br>\n\n<br>• Student/alumni management portal<br>\n\n<br>• Curricular feedback loops driven by placement outcomes |\n| **Industry** | • High volume of untargeted, low-quality applicants<br>\n\n<br>• High cost of candidate screening | • Targeted posting for internships, jobs, & apprenticeships<br>\n\n<br>• Automated candidate shortlisting algorithm based on skill weights<br>\n\n<br>• Channels to host learning programs & training initiatives |\n\n---\n\n### Shared Collaborative & Community Modules\n\n* **Industry–Academia Interaction:**\n* Innovation hackathons & competitive challenges\n* Hands-on workshops and guest lecture scheduling\n* 1-on-1 industry mentorship pipelines\n* Live enterprise projects & joint R&D research\n\n\n* **Student Peer Community:**\n* Discussion forums, preparation circles, and shared learning logs\n\n\n\n---\n\n### Technical & Engineering Decisions\n\n**1. Authentication & RBAC Hierarchy**\n\n* **Auth Protocol:** Hybrid OAuth2 (Google / GitHub for developers, Microsoft/Enterprise for universities) + standard JWT.\n* **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):**\n* `STUDENT`: Read/write personal portfolio, take assessments, apply to roles.\n* `FACULTY`: Access FDPs, apply to industry training, submit research proposals.\n* `INSTITUTE_ADMIN`: View institutional telemetry, batch-verify student credentials.\n* `RECRUITER`: Create job/internship listings, access candidate recommendation ranker.\n\n\n\n**2. Candidate Shortlisting & Matchmaking Engine**\n\n* Instead of basic string/regex keyword matching, compute cosine similarity between the job embedding and verified student skill vectors:\n\n$$\\text{Match Score} = \\frac{\\vec{S} \\cdot \\vec{J}}{\\Vert{}\\vec{S}\\Vert{} \\Vert{}\\vec{J}\\Vert{}}$$\n\n\n\nWhere $\\vec{S}$ represents student verified competencies and $\\vec{J}$ represents weighted role requirements.\n\n**3. Digital Portfolio & Verification**\n\n* Relational store tracking projects, external GitHub/live links, and skill badges.\n* Placement Cell or Faculty verification flag (`verified_by_institution = true`) to prevent fraudulent resumes.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for the futer \nHere is the structured breakdown of your Excalidraw whiteboard data, organized by user persona, functional modules, and technical architecture.\n\n---\n\n### Core Stakeholders & Pain Points\n\n| Persona | Core Pain Points & Needs | Key Deliverables / Features |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Students** | • Lack of clarity on industry standards & trends<br>\n\n<br>• Need objective skill measurement<br>\n\n<br>• Skill gaps without targeted learning paths<br>\n\n<br>• Irrelevant internship applications | • Dynamic Skill Assessment & gap visualization<br>\n\n<br>• Personalized career roadmap & training resources<br>\n\n<br>• Verified Digital Portfolio (skills, projects, certifications)<br>\n\n<br>• Automated resume builder tuned to specific job descriptions<br>\n\n<br>• Application tracking & AI HelpBot |\n| **Faculty** | • Low visibility into domain-specific industry exposure<br>\n\n<br>• Inability to align syllabus with live tech trends | • Self-service discovery for industrial training<br>\n\n<br>• Faculty Development Programs (FDPs)<br>\n\n<br>• Industry sabbaticals & consultancy matchmaking |\n| **Institutions** | • Disconnected student & alumni records<br>\n\n<br>• Blindness to real-time market skill demands | • Cohort-level skill & placement readiness dashboards<br>\n\n<br>• Student/alumni management portal<br>\n\n<br>• Curricular feedback loops driven by placement outcomes |\n| **Industry** | • High volume of untargeted, low-quality applicants<br>\n\n<br>• High cost of candidate screening | • Targeted posting for internships, jobs, & apprenticeships<br>\n\n<br>• Automated candidate shortlisting algorithm based on skill weights<br>\n\n<br>• Channels to host learning programs & training initiatives |\n\n---\n\n### Shared Collaborative & Community Modules\n\n* **Industry–Academia Interaction:**\n* Innovation hackathons & competitive challenges\n* Hands-on workshops and guest lecture scheduling\n* 1-on-1 industry mentorship pipelines\n* Live enterprise projects & joint R&D research\n\n\n* **Student Peer Community:**\n* Discussion forums, preparation circles, and shared learning logs\n\n\n\n---\n\n### Technical & Engineering Decisions\n\n**1. Authentication & RBAC Hierarchy**\n\n* **Auth Protocol:** Hybrid OAuth2 (Google / GitHub for developers, Microsoft/Enterprise for universities) + standard JWT.\n* **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):**\n* `STUDENT`: Read/write personal portfolio, take assessments, apply to roles.\n* `FACULTY`: Access FDPs, apply to industry training, submit research proposals.\n* `INSTITUTE_ADMIN`: View institutional telemetry, batch-verify student credentials.\n* `RECRUITER`: Create job/internship listings, access candidate recommendation ranker.\n\n\n\n**2. Candidate Shortlisting & Matchmaking Engine**\n\n* Instead of basic string/regex keyword matching, compute cosine similarity between the job embedding and verified student skill vectors:\n\n$$\\text{Match Score} = \\frac{\\vec{S} \\cdot \\vec{J}}{\\Vert{}\\vec{S}\\Vert{} \\Vert{}\\vec{J}\\Vert{}}$$\n\n\n\nWhere $\\vec{S}$ represents student verified competencies and $\\vec{J}$ represents weighted role requirements.\n\n**3. Digital Portfolio & Verification**\n\n* Relational store tracking projects, external GitHub/live links, and skill badges.\n* Placement Cell or Faculty verification flag (`verified_by_institution = true`) to prevent fraudulent resumes.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
